----------------------------------------------------------------
Datasets
----------------------------------------------------------------
CoDEx-M (Safavi & Koutra, 2020):
    https://github.com/tsafavi/codex
    Released under the CC-BY 4.0 license.

FB15k-237 (Toutanova & Chen, 2015):
    Derived from Freebase; distributed with entity texts by KG-BERT
    (github.com/yao8839836/kg-bert).

WN18RR (Dettmers et al., 2018):
    Derived from WordNet; distributed with entity texts by KG-BERT
    (github.com/yao8839836/kg-bert).

This project does not download or redistribute any dataset.

----------------------------------------------------------------
Pretrained models
----------------------------------------------------------------
The bi-encoder and the cross-encoder are initialized from
bert-base-uncased (huggingface.co/bert-base-uncased), released under
the Apache License 2.0 (Google AI Language).
